Package: mira-mail
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: nnoah29 <toffanoah@gmail.com>
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Depends: libgtk-3-0 | libgtk-3-0t64, libwebkit2gtk-4.1-0, libepoxy0, libfontconfig1, libc6 (>= 2.34), libstdc++6
Recommends: zenity | kdialog, xdg-utils, gnome-keyring | kwalletmanager
Section: mail
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/nnoah29/MIRA
Description: Desktop mail client that works offline
 MIRA keeps a full copy of your mail on your own computer, so everything
 opens instantly, works without a connection, and stays yours.
 .
 Connect Gmail, Outlook, Yahoo or any IMAP account and read, sort, search
 and write from a single, calm interface.
